{"sha": "97bc374e604687bd0b2e1c66e14e2308bad2d57718c1b91cf8a8eb965bd39bfd", "body": ["\\begin{proposition}\\label{prop:b3:forms:windinginteger}", "$\\operatorname{Ind}_\\gamma(a) \\in \\Z$；作为 $a$ 的函数，", "它在 $\\R^2\\setminus\\gamma(\\intcc01)$ 的每个连通分支上为常数，", "并在无界分支上为零。", "对于 $\\gamma(t) = a + r(\\cos2\\pi t, \\sin2\\pi t)$，有", "$\\operatorname{Ind}_\\gamma(a) = 1$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "取 $a = 0$，记 $\\gamma = (x, y)$，$\\rho =", "\\norm\\gamma > 0$，$\\vartheta(t) =", "\\int_0^t\\gamma^*\\omega_\\theta$，使得 $\\vartheta' =", "\\frac{xy' - yx'}{x^2 + y^2}$。在复记号下令 $u(t)", "= \\gamma(t)\\,\\rho(t)^{-1}\\eu^{-\\iu\\vartheta(t)}$；则", "$\\abs u = 1$，且直接计算可得", "\\[", "\\frac{u'}{u} = \\frac{\\gamma'}{\\gamma} - \\frac{\\rho'}{\\rho}", "- \\iu\\vartheta'", "= \\frac{\\bar\\gamma\\gamma'}{\\abs\\gamma^2} -", "\\frac{\\rho'}{\\rho} - \\iu\\,\\frac{xy' -", "yx'}{\\rho^2}", "= \\frac{(xx' + yy')}{\\rho^2} - \\frac{\\rho'}{\\rho} = 0,", "\\]", "由于 $\\bar\\gamma\\gamma' = (xx' + yy') + \\iu(xy' - yx')$，且", "$\\rho\\rho' = xx' + yy'$。故 $u$ 为常数：$\\gamma(t) =", "\\rho(t)\\,c\\,\\eu^{\\iu\\vartheta(t)}$，其中 $\\abs c = 1$，且", "$\\gamma(1) = \\gamma(0)$ 及 $\\rho(1) = \\rho(0)$ 蕴含", "$\\eu^{\\iu\\vartheta(1)} = \\eu^{\\iu\\vartheta(0)} = 1$:", "$\\vartheta(1) \\in 2\\pi\\Z$，即", "$\\operatorname{Ind}_\\gamma(0) \\in \\Z$。作为 $a$ 的函数，", "在紧曲线的开补集上，定义式中的积分", "是连续的（由\\cref{thm:b3:lebesgue:paramcont}，", "在每个 $a$ 的邻域上有可积控制）；", "连续的整值函数局部为常数，因而", "在各连通分支上为常数。当 $\\norm a$ 很大时，被积函数", "$O(1/\\norm a)$ 关于 $t$ 一致成立，于是环绕数趋于 $0$，", "从而在无界分支上为零。对于圆周，", "直接有 $\\gamma^*\\omega_\\theta^a = 2\\pi\\,\\dd t$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{remark}", "在 $\\C \\cong \\R^2$ 下，$\\frac{\\dd z}{z} = \\frac{x\\,\\dd x +", "y\\,\\dd y}{x^2 + y^2} + \\iu\\,\\omega_\\theta$，于是", "$\\operatorname{Ind}_\\gamma(a) =", "\\frac1{2\\iu\\pi}\\oint_\\gamma\\frac{\\dd z}{z - a}$：这正是", "\\cref{ch:b3:residues}中的环绕数，并且", "\\cref{prop:b3:forms:windinginteger}以实变量方法重新证明了它的", "整值性与局部常数性 ---", "这是留数定理中的拓扑一半，如今建立在", "斯托克斯公式之上。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{proposition}\\label{prop:b3:forms:exactloop}", "若 $\\omega = \\dd f$ 在开集 $U$ 上恰当，且", "$\\gamma\\colon\\intcc01\\to U$ 为闭曲线，则", "$\\int_\\gamma\\omega = 0$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$\\int_\\gamma\\dd f = \\int_0^1(f\\circ\\gamma)'(t)\\,\\dd t =", "f(\\gamma(1)) - f(\\gamma(0)) = 0$ --- 链式法则", "将 $\\gamma^*(\\dd f)$ 等同于 $(f\\circ\\gamma)'\\,\\dd t$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{method}\\label{met:b3:forms:method}", "计算微分形式时：（1）机械化 --- 楔积按符号重排，", "$\\dd$ 对系数求导并引入新的 $\\dd", "x_j$，拉回时作代换；信任代数运算，它", "编码了每一个雅可比行列式。（2）要在子流形上对形式积分：", "直接参数化，作拉回，再对系数积分；", "定向是唯一的陷阱 --- 检验一个标架。（3）要证明积分恒等式，", "就寻找 Stokes 型结构：被积函数是否恰当？", "区域是否为边界？（4）要比较两个“平行”子流形上的积分，", "只需对二者之间的区域应用 Stokes 公式", "（形变论证，", "见\\cref{exo:b3:forms:10}）。（5）闭形式的非零积分", "证明存在拓扑障碍 --- 无原函数，", "无收缩，无零点延拓：这正是", "周末问题排除球体收缩映射的方法。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b3:forms:1}", "在 $\\R^3$ 上，设 $\\omega = x\\,\\dd y - z\\,\\dd x$ 及 $\\eta =", "\\dd x + y\\,\\dd z$。计算 $\\omega\\wedge\\eta$，$\\dd\\omega$，", "$\\dd\\eta$，$\\dd(\\omega\\wedge\\eta)$，并在此例上验证", "分次莱布尼茨法则。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b3:forms:2}", "在 $\\R^3$ 上辨认 $\\dd$ 的三种形式：", "对 $f \\in \\Omega^0$，$\\dd f \\leftrightarrow \\nabla f$；对", "功形式 $\\omega_F = F_1\\dd x + F_2\\dd y + F_3\\dd z$，", "$\\dd\\omega_F \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{curl}F$；对", "通量形式 $\\sigma_F = F_1\\,\\dd y\\wedge\\dd z + F_2\\,\\dd", "z\\wedge\\dd x + F_3\\,\\dd x\\wedge\\dd y$，$\\dd\\sigma_F", "\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{div}F$。由 $\\dd^2 =", "0$ 推出恒等式 $\\operatorname{curl}\\nabla f = 0$ 与", "$\\operatorname{div}\\operatorname{curl}F = 0$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b3:forms:3}", "判断下列每个 $1$-形式是否为闭形式，在其定义域上是否恰当，", "并在存在时求出原函数：", "(a) $(2xy + z^2)\\,\\dd x + x^2\\,\\dd y + 2xz\\,\\dd z$ 在", "$\\R^3$ 上；", "(b) $\\dfrac{x\\,\\dd x + y\\,\\dd y}{x^2 + y^2}$ 在", "$\\R^2\\setminus\\{0\\}$ 上；", "(c) $\\dfrac{-y\\,\\dd x + x\\,\\dd y}{x^2 + y^2}$ 在", "半平面 $\\{x > 0\\}$ 上。", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}